1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,999
I glorify the name of Almighty Jesus, who was, who is, and who is to come.

2
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:30,999
It was on March 12, 2019; on that day, my husband met with an accident, and it was not a small accident—it was very serious.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,999
He had severe injuries and was admitted to Medical College, Kolenchery Medical College; my mother is a believer, but for me,

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,999
apart from having heard about God, I knew nothing about Him or about the Holy Mother; I am a non-Christian, but when such an accident happened,

5
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:59,999
I remembered a word my mother told me: this is not the time to weaken, not the time to cry—only pray.

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,999
She said only God can save, and at that very second, I felt as if something entered my heart.

7
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,999
Suddenly I remembered—my mother had once come to me and told me that we should go to Kreupasanam; when the newsletter came, I was the one who said,

8
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:28,999
“I’m not coming; you go,” but when the accident happened on March 12, the first thought that entered my mind was to go to the Holy Mother.

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:37,999
I insisted on going; my husband had both shoulders fractured, his spine fractured, and four fractures in the ribs.

10
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:46,999
He had nearly a hundred stitches on the back, and the doctors said four surgeries would be needed; I was extremely exhausted and broken.

11
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:56,999
When I came here, I had no hope at all, but in my heart I had faith that Mother would intervene; when I entered from outside,

12
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:05,999
what I experienced was truly like stepping from heat into coolness; I felt as if someone had touched me.

13
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:11,999
Until then I had been sitting and crying, but after that I stopped crying; at that time my younger sister was with me, and she told me,

14
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:21,999
“When we were standing outside, there was deep sorrow and pain, but when we came inside, I don’t know what it was—it was a very intense experience.”

15
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:29,999
I sat here and prayed; I don’t know anything, but I entrusted everything, and when I came out from here, it truly felt completely new.

16
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,999
Christ recreated me as a new creation; I came down from here, and around March 15,

17
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,999
I came here and took the Covenant, and I did not know how to pray at all.

18
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:49,999
During that time, my Holy Mother was with me and came alongside me; I cannot say otherwise—I used to pray only to Mother.

19
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:58,999
I did not know what to say or how to say it, but it is Mother who placed the rosary and the Holy Scripture into my hands.

20
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:08,999
Within just a few days after taking the Covenant, there was a strong desire for the Scripture and likewise for the rosary; I did not know how to read,

21
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:16,999
I did not know how to learn, I did not know how to pray; yet I would wake up here at five-thirty in the morning and pray, with only one desire.

22
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:26,999
My husband had nearly eighty-five percent damage to his spine, and the doctors said he would not be able to walk, but my faith was great.

23
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:32,999
I prayed, and this alone is what I said to Mother: I want nothing else—just let him stand up.

24
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:42,999
I casually fixed a date—April 16th—and on that April 16th, my husband stood up and walked; the doctors had said four surgeries were needed,

25
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:51,999
but without any of those four surgeries, the Holy Mother granted healing and blessed him; likewise, the second time I came here to renew the Covenant—

26
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:59,999
I am not someone who renews it again—but when I came a second time to renew the Covenant, it was in October 2022 that I came here.

27
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:08,999
That day, my mother’s sister-in-law—whom I call my aunt, the elder sister-in-law—suddenly, I was actually preparing to come to give testimony,

28
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:18,999
but by that morning, suddenly my aunt’s blood pressure rose, three nerves ruptured, and her whole body was filled with blood.

29
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:31,999
They called us urgently and told us this, and I said, “Don’t be afraid”; they are not people of faith, they go to church, and I only said we will pray.

30
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:40,999
Truly, I had come out with an intense desire to give testimony, but when I came here and renewed the Covenant, the very first thing that came into my mind

31
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:47,999
was my aunt’s situation—she was lying motionless in Kottayam Medical College—and when I came here and took the Covenant, the very first intention Right there on the spot,

32
00:04:48,000 --> 00:05:00,999
I received a call from there saying that she had stood up, and within a week she was discharged; an even greater miracle than that was this: though three nerves had ruptured,

33
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:08,999
when they did the scan, two of them were completely fine, and there was no problem at all; only one had a small issue,

34
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:17,999
and they immediately did an angiogram, and within a week she was healed and returned home; the third time I came here and took the Covenant and went home,

35
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,999
my grandmother had cancer—I did not know it,

36
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:30,999
but God revealed it; the cancer had severely affected the liver, and the doctors had said she had only three months to live; seeing her in such pain,

37
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:39,999
honestly one would feel like breaking down, but suddenly a thought God gave me was this—the blessed honey from here; Mother told me to give just a drop,

38
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:47,999
so I prayed and gave it into my grandmother's mouth; my grandmother was not a believer and was not someone who prayed,

39
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:54,999
but she was someone who sat with me, and I gave it, and right on the spot my grandmother began to sleep; there was no pain,

40
00:05:55,000 --> 00:06:06,999
no distress—until her death, God took her without any pain or suffering, and that was a great grace given to me and my family—to witness that; along with that,

41
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:10,999
my grandmother—externally she had no consciousness,

42
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:19,999
but inwardly she had full awareness; from the moment the honey went inside, the one who had no faith began to glorify God,

43
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:28,999
sing His songs, worship, and praise Him; this became a great miracle that I, my family members, and my neighbors all stood watching

44
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:41,999
and witnessed; this is what I felt; I have many such things to say, but this is not what God entrusted me to say here; the reason I came here to speak is an accident,

45
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:45,999
but after I came here, took the Covenant, and went home,

46
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:53,999
when about three months passed, I began to think of stopping the Covenant—not because I am not very old,

47
00:06:54,000 --> 00:07:02,999
I thought of stopping; it was at that time that I, who had been praying only to Mother, suddenly began to feel Jesus entering into my heart,

48
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:10,999
and as I began to see and hear more of the Lord’s Divine Mercy chaplet and other prayers, I started to know Jesus more closely.

49
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:18,999
I began to think deeply—why is this happening? There are many Christians living around me, but to whom could I go to ask,

50
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:28,999
to speak, or to learn prayer? The Lord did not allow me; permission was not given—I did not ask anyone; I prayed only to Mother.

51
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:36,999
From the presence of that Holy Mother, I say this: if I came here because of an accident, when I went back, truly speaking,

52
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:45,999
it was to live a life according to the Lord’s plan, to pray with my eyes fixed on heaven, and to be raised by the Lord as a grace

53
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:52,999
to help save many souls for eternity; I cannot fully express it—Jesus taught me that much, and with Jesus,

54
00:07:53,000 --> 00:08:01,999
I was able to form such a deep spiritual bond with the Holy Mother that I cannot describe it; like a child to a mother, I prayed only one thing.

55
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:10,999
I want to become like Mother; like Mother, I want to love Jesus; Jesus led me through many sufferings—alone, without companions,

56
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:18,999
through loneliness and many pains and trials, and only after that did God bring me to stand here today at the altar of Kreupasanam.

57
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:27,999
At that time, there is a word I often hear—people say there is no peace, no rest, only complaints and grievances; yet in the same way,

58
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:38,999
without telling anyone, I withdrew into a room and began to speak with Jesus; I could not see Him, I could not hear Him, but my sorrows slowly,

59
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:46,999
gradually began to lessen; I began to have a strong desire toward Jesus—knowing that I am not alone, God is with me.

60
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:56,999
Thus, little by little, within about one year, Jesus Himself taught me about Christian life, about how one becomes a Christian, and how a person

61
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:06,999
who believes in Jesus is formed; to be able to hear this directly and experience it is the greatest blessing I see, and for that,

62
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:15,999
my greatest thanks go to heaven; I have seen many miracles and signs, but the one thing Jesus taught me is this—greater than the miracles and signs I do,

63
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:24,999
the greatest is Jesus Christ, the living Son, the Son of the living God, who is alive even today; He sent me saying that

64
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:33,999
I must stand at the altar and testify this to the world, and it is only because He sent me that I stand here today; for many years now, almost five years

65
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:43,999
I am trying to come here and give testimony, but time was not permitted; I could not move forward without standing united with God’s will and praying, without knowing the Lord’s will.

66
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:52,999
And to those who take this Covenant, I have only one thing to say: I am a person who has experienced Jesus every single second,

67
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,999
and there is only one reason for that—humility.

68
00:09:56,000 --> 00:10:06,999
Become humble; I am nothing—I told Jesus, “Lord, now I am nothing,” and I knelt before Him; I was not someone who could even take up the Bible.

69
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:16,999
We were taught to recite, but I had a deep longing to read the Word, yet I could not; so I would tell the Lord of my desire to read the Word.

70
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:24,999
I would say, “Jesus, I want to read this,” and the Lord would say, “You must come to Me completely,” and so I prayed to Jesus.

71
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:34,999
I told Him, “Jesus, I surrender myself completely to You,” and kneeling before the Lord, I said to Jesus that from today onward,

72
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:42,999
I would be your disciple and You would be my Master; I wanted to learn the Word, and sitting before the Lord, I opened the Bible.

73
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:47,999
From that day onward, the Word began to enter into me; I began to learn the verses one by one.

74
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:55,999
God placed more than five hundred verses into my heart, but those verses were not meant to be kept within me alone.

75
00:10:56,000 --> 00:11:02,999
I began to speak them to each person, and without realizing it, I was speaking Jesus Himself; then He made me understand one thing in life—

76
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:10,999
it is not miracles or signs that are the greatest; for peace, calm, and joy to enter into a family, the very first and most essential thing a person needs

77
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:22,999
is to recognize the living God—this is what the Lord made me understand; God has given me the most beautiful family life in my life.

78
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:29,999
Even the places I go are blessed, as He comes close to me and moves with me; more than anything, He taught me to recognize and love Jesus

79
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:37,999
even more than the Holy Mother—this is the deepest truth; I once thought Mother was everything.

80
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:47,999
But when Mother placed the Lord’s hand into my hands, I understood how much more I must love Jesus, how much He loves me,

81
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:53,999
and why He went to the Cross for this world—God Himself taught me all of this.

82
00:11:54,000 --> 00:12:00,999
This is all I have to say, and I cannot refrain from saying it—the Lord Himself taught me the growth of a spiritual life.

83
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:09,999
I followed the words of the Covenant correctly, and likewise, humbling myself, I would always kneel before Jesus and pray.

84
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:19,999
Wherever I went, whatever I did, and whatever I said, I would speak with Jesus; to know the Lord’s will, the very first thing is to kneel.

85
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:26,999
I would tell Him—more than telling any human being, I would tell Jesus, because in my life not even one person has helped me.

86
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:35,999
Even if we tell people, it gives us nothing—there is happiness for a short while, but after some time it turns again into sorrow; but to know that we have a Jesus,

87
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:45,999
a God, who comes searching for us again and again, we must have a heart that opens before the Lord our pains, sorrows, joys,

88
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:52,999
even the smallest things; this is the Covenant—this is the greatest treasure the Holy Mother gave me.

89
00:12:53,000 --> 00:13:01,999
Not any other thing—not the blessings I received, not the miracles, nothing else—but that I could proclaim from the altar that Jesus is the Son of the living God—this opportunity the Lord gave me,

90
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:06,999
and I rejoice in Christ and take pride in it.

91
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:14,999
I give thanks to God, because I can come here today and proclaim the God who is, who was, and who is to come.

92
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:28,999
In these Covenant testimonies, there are many testimonies spoken from this realization, and perhaps receiving this daughter’s testimony at this time

93
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:39,999
itself we consider as a great blessing; Father often says that some testimonies are given by Mother like gifts at different times.

94
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:50,999
And in this testimony, very clearly, to a certain extent, a girl who was a non-Christian, without anyone’s help, moved her life of faith forward,

95
00:13:51,000 --> 00:14:06,999
learned what the very foundation of Christian faith is, and glorified the name of God—perhaps even those who have lived many years in Christian life

96
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:13,999
have not understood that the purpose of life is to glorify the name of God.

97
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:21,999
When I hear it said—whether there or here—that God revealed even a great revelation, I view this testimony with a deep sense of awe and wonder.

98
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:26,999
Usually, we may have a mentor—someone who teaches us about the Lord; perhaps everyone has someone like that.

99
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:32,999
Here, many people give testimonies—people have names, backgrounds, mentors—but in this case, what this daughter is saying

100
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:39,999
is not something she learned academically; when she says that it was Mother who taught her to hold the hand of Jesus in life,

101
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:51,999
that itself reveals Mother’s greatest mission; this goes far beyond what people say after attending classes or listening to sermons— to be able to say this from personal experience means that one has received grace,

102
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:55,999
and that itself is the success of the Covenant or of prayer.

103
00:14:56,000 --> 00:15:03,999
Then she says she came because of an accident, but that is not what she really came to speak about; perhaps in the Covenant,

104
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:11,999
the most important thing—as Father always reminds us—is that marriage, accidents, OET, IELTS, and all such things are only pathways of the Covenant, not the goal.

105
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:17,999
Romans chapter 10, verse 9 says that the most important thing is to enable a person to confess with the lips that Jesus is Lord

106
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:29,999
and to believe in the heart that God raised Him from the dead; perhaps even those who give testimonies at a higher spiritual level are few.

107
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:37,999
Often, those who give such testimonies are people who came to know Christ, the Bible, the Lord, and the Mother only years later;

108
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:45,999
sometimes people suddenly come into a higher degree of prayer or faith experience—this becomes clear when you examine testimonies.

109
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:52,999
In the testimony this daughter shared, what stands out clearly is eternity, intimacy with God, and the truth that nothing should be done without asking Jesus.

110
00:15:53,000 --> 00:16:00,999
When she says that Mother placed her hand into the hands of Jesus and that Mother showed her Jesus, all of that shows a life of faith lived without human support.

111
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:06,999
And finally, what is said is this: do not rely on kings, do not rely on human beings—rely only on God.

112
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:13,999
When someone says from personal experience that one must rely only on Jesus, it is not theoretical; perhaps she has written and learned nearly five hundred verses.

113
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:21,999
The words she speaks now—like “Lord, sanctify me,” and speaking about living for the glory of His name—

114
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:27,999
all these carry the taste of the Word; these are things that come only to those who read the Bible.

115
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:35,999
When she says that she read the Bible so much and that it somehow came into her hands, then in this testimony itself, this daughter

116
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:41,999
has clearly said and concluded what the true goal of the Covenant is; there is no need for any further explanation.

117
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:48,999
The Covenant can bring a person to this level in a very short time, even at a young age, in a very personal way.

118
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:56,999
In this formula of faith, when we clearly take even one or two steps forward, there is absolutely no doubt that God will stand with us.

119
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:04,999
We have all been blessed to hear this testimony, and even those who will hear testimonies in the future

120
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:17,999
must say that this itself is the goal of the Covenant—to hold the hand of God all the way to eternity and to glorify the living God in this world.

121
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:31,999
Everything else becomes only a reason or a means; especially the matters of the sister, the mother, and all other concerns— none of these stand above that revelation; all of them remain beneath it,

122
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:35,999
and especially today, at this altar,

123
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,999
though she had come many times, she could not give testimony earlier; today was for that purpose.

124
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:49,999
At first I asked—normally, when we give testimony about a major healing of a patient, we do not allow it to be spoken without witnesses; that is our general policy.

125
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,999
When she said, “I want to glorify the name of God; this is not what I want to speak about—there is something else I want to say,”

126
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:57,999
it was then that this journey continued.

127
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:05,999
As we listen, we understand that this itself is what we intended—because in her life, the true spirit of Christianity, the Spirit of Christ,

128
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:16,999
without anyone teaching her—perhaps the worship here helped—but personally encountering Jesus like this is something many people experience through the Covenant, and that itself is a great blessing.

129
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:25,999
Very especially, as she moves forward, may she receive even greater revelations from the Lord, and may this divine experience become a great blessing for many people.

130
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:32,999
Let us thank God for the Covenant prayer, which helped bind a person into such a divine experience.

131
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:41,999
The true mission of the Holy Mother is to teach us to hold the hand of Jesus; that itself is the most fundamental truth.

132
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:44,999
And this is the goal of our life—to confess that Jesus is Lord.

133
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:51,999
If these two realizations were received through this testimony, then this must be called one of the greatest testimonies of the Covenant.

134
00:18:52,000 --> 00:19:00,999
As this daughter continues forward, we pray that she may receive many blessings and the presence of God, and that she may share this experience with many people.

135
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:06,999
Let us applaud with our hands and glorify the name of God for all the experiences God has given.

136
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:18,999
Extraordinary divine experiences can be yours too. If you have not yet subscribed to this YouTube channel, subscribe now.

137
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:23,000
Share this video with your friends right now and become messengers of the Lord.
